{"name":"Cuddle Bug","hex":"#c1e0be","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"cuddle bug","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A cuddly person or animal.","A term of endearment, especially for a young girl or a female relationship partner."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/cuddle_bug"}],"entries":[{"title":"Hug","blocks":[{"text":"A hug is a form of endearment, found in virtually all human communities, in which two or more people put their arms around the neck, back, under the armpits or waists of one another and hold each other closely. If more than two people are involved, it may be referred to as a group hug."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c0/Wedding_hugs.jpg/330px-Wedding_hugs.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hug","wikidata":"Q328703"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/A_Yoruba_bride_and_mother.JPG/500px-A_Yoruba_bride_and_mother.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/A_Yoruba_bride_and_mother.JPG/1280px-A_Yoruba_bride_and_mother.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/A_Yoruba_bride_and_mother.JPG/500px-A_Yoruba_bride_and_mother.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A Yoruba bride and mother","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AA_Yoruba_bride_and_mother.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ab/2017-08-04-Paul_Reimer-Beach_Volleyball_Medals-043_%2836352501196%29.jpg/500px-2017-08-04-Paul_Reimer-Beach_Volleyball_Medals-043_%2836352501196%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ab/2017-08-04-Paul_R